  "notes": "Dark zinc IDE-style API client. Layered near-black surfaces (#0a0a0b rail, #141416 sidebar/panels, #18181b main) with indigo #6366f1 primary on New and Send. HTTP methods are colour-coded pills (POST amber, GET green, GQL purple). Code uses a VS Code Dark+ token palette (#9cdcfe keys, #ce9178 strings, #b5cea8-ish numbers) in JetBrains Mono with indent guides. Template variables like {{baseUrl}} are highlighted amber inside the URL input. The response status line shows '201 Created' in bold green plus timing and size. Request tabs are person-created document tabs that show a close × on hover. The bottom status bar has terminal/console toggles and a stacked/side-by-side layout switch."
